# Mutable local counter the tasks.csv watcher writes as it runs (how many
# rows have been imported so far). Must NEVER be tracked -- committing it
# ships this dev machine's own already-imported count to every fresh
# deploy, permanently convincing a brand-new, empty database that
# nothing needs importing. Must start absent on every new deployment.
